<title>GREECE: BOURSE CLEARING HOUSE FAILS TO CASH SETTLE WITH BROKER.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLEARING HOUSE FAILS TO CASH SETTLE WITH BROKER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange's clearing house failed to cash settle with at least one member firm on Thursday, a broker at the firm who wished to stay anonymous told Reuters.</p>
<p>Although the amount was small, the member firm said it did not receive funds due it by the clearing house on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reuters contacted the clearing house but was told that the business day was over and there was no one who could answer any questions.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
